{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S05、S12、S13压缩了部分关键动机，尤其是从害怕给对方负担到害怕自己受伤的心理转变，不如X交代得完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更适合边听音乐边扫屏幕：话句短，重点突出，感受短句与音乐段落结合，观众容易迅速抓住情绪变化；水面、小船、波浪、光线等意象也形成了比较连贯的感官世界。它的细节比X更具体，情绪层次也更丰富。不过X在人物心理动机、前后因果和情感转变的交代上更完整，尤其是S05和S13，Y为了简洁牺牲了一部分故事的内在逻辑。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e93c497e-2dea-4e53-9c80-a6ef05f091cf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T082803676839Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:29:01.308891+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5dd4739990671912f24cdaf7a09c07337b70254d4c35e2e58f907b57095ad31e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": 